-- docs/adr/0001-incomplete-metadata.md --
# ADR-0001: Incomplete Metadata

* **Status**: Accepted
* **Date**: 2026-10-21

<!-- semedit-adr-metadata:v1 keys=summary,description,role,scope,area,languages; do not change key names or order. -->
| Key | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| summary | Keep an incomplete source record from publishing. |
| description | Reject a missing required metadata row. |
| role | contract |
| scope | documentation |
| languages | generic |

## Context

Malformed records cannot safely feed a generated register.

## Decision

Reject records that omit required metadata.

## Invariants

* Index generation validates every source record.

## Consequences

An incomplete record cannot produce misleading search results.
